Z||000008||DaRkLoRD||08-13-2000||02:15 PM||||Monkeyman, er.. I said mecham "style".. yeah, that's it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Anyway, what kind are the ones I posted? and btw, I do prefer the mecham ones with the strakes..<P>ur2biteme, I *wish* I owned that.. It was Archie's car. I just posted the pics here to show the IRM scoops..<P>I doubt I'd fit in a chopped Fiero either.. I'm 6'2".. although I do fit in a stock Fiero without having the seat all the way back.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A><p>[This message has been edited by DaRkLoRD (edited 08-13-2000).]||||reg||1
