Z||000021||trigger||08-14-2000||09:52 PM||||The way you can tell the mecham scoops(the ones with the stakes) from the fiero store scoops is that the mecham are made of the same enduro material as the doors and they flex.  The fiero stores are rigid fiberglass.  My friend said that the fiero store side scoops take hours of sanding to get all the low spots out of them.  Hope this helps.<P>------------------<BR>Honestly officer, I was just keeping up with the flow of traffic.  I know there aren't any cars in the area, that's how far behind I am.||||reg||1
